Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 05:19:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 27/53] Wire the buttons of hosted Bilibili pages

The cover manager, outside the Windows client, reports Cancel and
Confirm to the page that embeds it; opened on its own it had no parent,
so both buttons did nothing. Stand in for that parent and close the
window (after the success toast on Confirm).

The face verification page closes itself when verification ends; retry
going live then instead of only closing. New-window links open Bilibili
pages in place and other sites in the default browser. In the login
window, Forgot password and the agreements open in the browser, alerts
show, and a sign-in that returns to the page without LoginSuccess
(third-party login) completes once the cookies are there.

Hosted pages log failed requests, page errors and toasts (host and path
only) to diagnose problems such as cover uploads.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
